  "question": {
    "text": "The displacement of simple harmonic oscillator after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;seconds starting from its mean position is equal to half of its amplitude. The time period of harmonic motion is"
  },
  "options": [
